<title>USA: Eastman Kodak to stop disc film manufacturing.</title>
<headline>Eastman Kodak to stop disc film manufacturing.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastman Kodak Co said on Friday that it would discontinue Kodak Gold disc film manufacturing for disc cameras by December 31, 1998.</p>
<p>The company said that newer photographic technology has eclipsed disc photography.</p>
<p>Eastman Kodak said it would offer a consumer incentive program later this year to invite disc camera users to switch to Kodak Advantix camera and film products.</p>
<p>((--New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
